// THC (Thunder Hill Cinema) preview curation — cinema/film/art-leaning public
// PeerTube instances, drawing from EXISTING instances (aggregator model). Probed
// reachable 2026-08-25. This is a preview list for the web spike; the canonical
// branded app (thc-plate) will own the real curation + a THC primary backend.
[
  {
    name: "Cinema — PeerTube Uno",
